    end of this turn, change its ATK to 0, also negate that face-up monster's effects.
    You can only use this effect of \"Clear Wing Fast Dragon\" once per turn. If
    this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can
    place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
